"author": {"steamid": "76561198222559224", "personaname": "DestroyAllMonsters", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198222559224/", "num_games_owned": 66, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1685, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1276, "last_played": 1776386092, "avatar": "b28fc42980dbf3c3c5ccbff50ef9ca45ccea3b81"}, "language": "english", "review": "absolutely positivily %100 amazing. i love this game to pieces. The characters are diverse and there are many secrets to be found. would be worth it if it was $100 and is only $10.", "timestamp_created": 1485819515, "timestamp_updated": 1485819515, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29593153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029131086", "personaname": "Little.Riddle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029131086/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 3671, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3626, "last_played": 1617426997, "avatar": "56878ef6d9a206679fcd62cf194843e8806e8e56"}, "language": "english", "review": "+", "timestamp_created": 1485811292, "timestamp_updated": 1485811292, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29591702", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067552337", "personaname": "\"His Name Is Robert Paulsen\" Guy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kleinbottle/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 6064, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5861, "last_played": 1660855501, "avatar": "090c472e9992bc246cd93bfc88d9f2b15294c5a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is very fun.  Run around and kill a decent variety of monsters that keep spawning, picking up money and getting random powerups to keep making your character better and better, but the longer you play, the stronger the monsters get.  Die once, game over.  Start over.  If you survive and beat the game, you can finish in around 60-90 minutes, There is lots of replayability with all the things you can unlock.  The different characters you can get all play very differently, giving playthroughs lots of variety.  The game options you can unlock will also drastically affect the gameplay, adding more variety.  The art style is done very well, simple pixel art with lots of detail.\n\nAbout the only flaw I found in the game is the online multiplayer.  Rather than joining a lobby or being able to invite friends to the game, you actually have to enter a friend's IP address to join a game.  Weird.  I have not had to do that to play with friends since the '90s.", "timestamp_created": 1485805818, "timestamp_updated": 1485805818, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}